<title>INDIA: India RBI accepts repo bids for 12.5 bln rupees.</title>
<headline>India RBI accepts repo bids for 12.5 bln rupees.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Tuesday it accepted two bids for 12.50 billion rupees in the three-day repo auction.  </p>
<p>The central bank said it had received five bids for 33.50 billion rupees but accepted only two.</p>
<p>The weighted average rate was 4.90 percent.</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
</text>
